OL,3,GNEWSABakery 'too successful' to stay at
OL,4,ABorough Market
OL,5,
OL,6,FBread Ahead started as a small market
OL,7,Fstall selling two types of sourdough, a
OL,8,Fbrownie and some biscuits.
OL,10,FSome Mondays it would sell only 20
OL,11,Floaves, according to founder Matthew
OL,12,FJones.
OL,14,FThirteen years later, the business has
OL,15,Fexpanded to several sites across the
OL,16,Fworld, with a new bakery opening soon
OL,17,Fin New York.
OL,19,FBut customers visiting the original
OL,20,Fstall at Borough Market near London
OL,21,FBridge for its doughnuts may soon be
OL,22,Fdisappointed.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
